#: kcmaccess.cpp:368
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following features: "
"\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""

